# A building taken down burns on the basic content set: the woodcutter's hut of layouts/woodcutter.jsonc at 13,10 is razed with the
# Remove button, stays drawn with the basic set's flames over it, which flicker from shot to shot, and is gone once the burn frees its
# node. It needs no install. Run it with:
#   sh tools/play-run.sh basic-burning --layout layouts/woodcutter.jsonc --content-set basic --fps 10
wait 0.3
scroll up 2
name hut 13 10 building
shot standing 13 10 1 3

button Remove
click-tile 13 10
button Remove
wait 0.1
shot burning 13 10 1 3
wait 0.5
shot burning-later 13 10 1 3

# The burn's countdown of 0x7ff clock units runs out, and the slot is freed.
fast-forward until count woodcutter-hut = 0 max 20000
wait 0.3
expect-gone hut
shot freed 13 10 1 3
